# S-021 profile/tier/level merging between VPS and SPS (and several SPS) in obs_parse_hevc_header.
# State starts at: tier 0, level 0, profile_idc 0, compat = 0xffffffff, constraint = 0xffffffffffff.
# For every general profile_tier_level seen (VPS, then each SPS in file order):
#   profile_space := new value (last wins)
#   if tier < new_tier : level := new_level      (a higher tier REPLACES the level, even by a lower one)
#   else               : level := max(level, new_level)
#   tier := max, profile_idc := max, compat &= new, constraint &= new
# numTemporalLayers := max(max_sub_layers_minus1 + 1) over VPS and SPS;
# chromaFormat, bit depths and temporalIdNested come from the LAST SPS.
